@startuml editor-mode
' Editor modes (EDT-02, EDT-06, EDT-07, EDT-10). See docs/ui/screens/editor.md (SCR-06).
title Editor mode
[*] --> Edit : new note, or empty body / empty checklist
[*] --> Preview : existing note and default mode = View
[*] --> Edit : existing note and default mode = Edit
[*] --> ReadOnly : note is in the bin
Preview --> Edit : mode switch (FAB or top bar)
Edit --> Preview : mode switch\n(not offered while the note is empty)
state Edit {
  [*] --> Text
  Text --> Checklist : Convert to list
  Checklist --> Text : Convert to note\n(check marks are lost: 2026-11-12 finding)
}
ReadOnly --> [*] : Restore / Delete permanently (editor closes)
Edit --> [*] : back; an empty new note is discarded
Preview --> [*] : back / Archive / Delete (editor closes)
@enduml

@startuml folder-lifecycle
' The notes-folder lifecycle (FLD-01…FLD-10, UC-01, UC-02, UC-12). See docs/ui/screens/settings.md.
title Notes folder lifecycle
[*] --> NoFolder : fresh install
[*] --> PendingConfirm : upgrade with a folder from the old version
NoFolder : notes live only in the app\nonboarding dialog (DLG-01), drawer prompt
PendingConfirm : nothing read or written (FLD-04)\nDLG-02 asks
PendingConfirm --> Confirmed : Use this folder\n(relink by content, FLD-05)
PendingConfirm --> NoFolder : Not now
PendingConfirm --> Choosing : Choose another folder
NoFolder --> Choosing : Select Storage location
Choosing : system folder picker\nDLG-04 once per cloud-provider folder
Choosing --> Confirmed : first folder: export every note once,\nlink files that already match (FLD-03)
Confirmed : sync runs (BGD)\nhistory recorded (HST)
Confirmed --> Switching : pick a different folder
Switching : DLG-03
Switching --> Confirmed : Move my notes here\n(copy; old files stay, FLD-08)
Switching --> Confirmed : Open this folder as-is\n(FLD-09)
Switching --> Confirmed : Cancel (old folder kept)
@enduml
